  at the end of a run (AFTER all relaxation, molecular dynamics, etc.).

  | Total energy of the DFT / Hartree-Fock s.c.f. calculation      :         -10094.693561267 eV
  | Final zero-broadening corrected energy (caution - metals only) :         -10094.693561267 eV
